    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d497-a1">

                <pb facs="0949" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg825"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Mariscal to
                        Señor Navarro.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 11,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>As the President desires to conclude a new treaty with the Government of the
                    United States, in relation to naturalization and citizenship, that may he more
                    in accord with the laws of mexico than is the convention which was concluded
                    July 10, 1868, he desires that, in accordance with article 5 of that instrument,
                    you should notify the United States Government of the desire of this government
                    for its termination at the expiration of the twelve months mentioned in the
                    aforesaid article.</p>
                <p>You will consequently be pleased to send a copy of this note to the honorable
                    Secretary of State, and to inform this department of the date of such
                    communication.</p>
                <p>I renew, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>MARISCAL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
